  "description": "Register Here! Registration for all Aurora Cultural Centre programs is on the Town of Aurora’s e-PLAY website. All programs continue to be part of the Aurora Cultural Centre. September 15 – November 10, 2025 [SKIP October 13] Mondays | 6:30 – 9:00 pm | Ages 16+ Aurora Town Square – ATS Art Activity Room 50 Victoria Street, Aurora Unlock the artistry within wood, whether you are a beginner or a seasoned wood turner. Learn to create intricate reliefs to dynamic sculptural pieces in the round. All materials are provided by the instructor for $80 plus $120 refundable deposit for the borrowed tools. Please note the breakdown of those materials below Materials List",
